  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Efficiency audit (Wajibu Institute for Public Accountability)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Efficiency audit (Wajibu Institute for Public Accountability)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WAJIBU is a Tanzanian non-governmental organization whose aim is to contribute to positive change in people&#x2019;s lives and to hold duty bearers to account for the respect, protection and fulfilment of human rights. The contribution seeks to address the challenge of barely functional accountability mechanisms at local level as well as the lack of spaces for inclusive dialog. This entails constructive interaction among duty bearers and right holders.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WAJIBU &#xE4;r en tanzanisk icke-statlig organisation vars m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att bidra till positiv f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring i m&#xE4;nniskors liv och att h&#xE5;lla pliktb&#xE4;rare till svars f&#xF6;r respekt, skydd och uppfyllelse av m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter. Bidraget syftar till att ta itu med utmaningen med knappt fungerande ansvarsmekanismer p&#xE5; lokal niv&#xE5; samt bristen p&#xE5; utrymmen f&#xF6;r inkluderande dialog. Detta inneb&#xE4;r ett konstruktivt samspel mellan pliktb&#xE4;rare och r&#xE4;ttighetshavare.</narrative>
  </description>
